[
    {
        "content": "<p>Let <code>α</code> be a type and <code>ωSequence α</code> be the type of infinite sequences over <code>α</code> (which you can think of as objects of type <code>ℕ → α</code>).  A natural topology on <code>ωSequence α</code> has the following set as a basis:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ωSequence</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">univ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ωSequence</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>That is, <code>p</code> is the set of infinite sequences that share <code>l</code> as a finite prefix.  Does this topology have a name?  Is it already defined in mathlib?</p>",
        "id": 608164313,
        "sender_full_name": "Ching-Tsun Chou",
        "timestamp": 1783141194
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I think it's the product topology (<a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Pi.topologicalSpace#doc\">docs#Pi.topologicalSpace</a>) if <code>α</code> is endowed with discrete topology.</p>",
        "id": 608165104,
        "sender_full_name": "Jz Pan",
        "timestamp": 1783141910
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>If you give alpha the discrete topology then I should think the type <code>Nat -&gt; alpha</code> automatically gets this topology.</p>",
        "id": 608168113,
        "sender_full_name": "Kevin Buzzard",
        "timestamp": 1783145406
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>(Just FYI, you can link to CSLib definitions like <a href=\"https://api.cslib.io/docs/find/?pattern=%CF%89Sequence#doc\">cslib#ωSequence</a>)</p>",
        "id": 608186239,
        "sender_full_name": "Chris Henson",
        "timestamp": 1783164349
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Hmm that didn't work, maybe because of the Unicode?</p>",
        "id": 608186317,
        "sender_full_name": "Chris Henson",
        "timestamp": 1783164421
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Does <a href=\"https://api.cslib.io/docs/find/?pattern=Cslib.%CF%89Sequence#doc\">cslib#Cslib.ωSequence</a> work? (Yes!)</p>",
        "id": 608212686,
        "sender_full_name": "Kevin Buzzard",
        "timestamp": 1783187844
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Thanks for the replies!  Indeed I was thinking of <a href=\"https://api.cslib.io/docs/find/?pattern=Cslib.%CF%89Sequence#doc\">cslib#Cslib.ωSequence</a>.</p>",
        "id": 608215776,
        "sender_full_name": "Ching-Tsun Chou",
        "timestamp": 1783191435
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>It turns out that the definition I gave above is a theorem in mathlib already: <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=PiNat.isTopologicalBasis_cylinders#doc\">docs#PiNat.isTopologicalBasis_cylinders</a></p>",
        "id": 608229696,
        "sender_full_name": "Ching-Tsun Chou",
        "timestamp": 1783207655
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Now a question: As you see in <a href=\"https://api.cslib.io/docs/find/?pattern=Cslib.%CF%89Sequence#doc\">cslib#Cslib.ωSequence</a>, an object of type <code>ωSequence α</code> is an object of type <code>ℕ → α</code> is wrapped in a structure.  What is the best way to port the product topology on <code>ℕ → α</code> to become a topology on <code>ωSequence α</code>, so that I can easily apply theorems about the former to the latter?</p>",
        "id": 608230317,
        "sender_full_name": "Ching-Tsun Chou",
        "timestamp": 1783208495
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I guess you can use <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=TopologicalSpace.induced#doc\">docs#TopologicalSpace.induced</a> to create the topology and then bundle the constructor as a <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Homeomorph#doc\">docs#Homeomorph</a> between <code>ωSequence α</code> and <code>ℕ → WithDiscreteTopology α</code>.</p>",
        "id": 608232601,
        "sender_full_name": "Robin Arnez",
        "timestamp": 1783210047
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>you can also use <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=TopologicalSpace.coinduced#doc\">docs#TopologicalSpace.coinduced</a> which has better defeq properties</p>",
        "id": 608233613,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1783210245
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>It turns out this is already in mathlib: <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/Mathlib/Topology/Homeomorph/TransferInstance.html\">https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/Mathlib/Topology/Homeomorph/TransferInstance.html</a></p>",
        "id": 608237790,
        "sender_full_name": "Ching-Tsun Chou",
        "timestamp": 1783211063
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I am having trouble getting Lean's type checking to do what I want it to do.  Consider the following code:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">module</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Cslib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Foundations</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Data</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">OmegaSequence</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Init</span>\n<span class=\"n\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Topology</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Constructions</span>\n<span class=\"n\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Topology</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Homeomorph</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">TransferInstance</span>\n<span class=\"n\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Topology</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">MetricSpace</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">PiNat</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\">/-</span><span class=\"cm\">!</span>\n<span class=\"cm\"># Temporal reasoning over infinite sequences.</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">-/</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">expose</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">section</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Homeomorph</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">namespace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Cslib</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">PiNat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">topologicalSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">@</span><span class=\"n\">Pi</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">topologicalSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℕ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℕ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℕ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊥</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">namespace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ωSequence</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">equivPiNat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ωSequence</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ℕ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">toFun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ωSequence</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">invFun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ωSequence</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mk</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">left_inv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">right_inv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">topologicalSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">@</span><span class=\"n\">Equiv</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">topologicalSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ωSequence</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ℕ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">PiNat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">topologicalSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">equivPiNat</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">homeomorph</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">@</span><span class=\"n\">Equiv</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">homeomorph</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ωSequence</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ℕ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">PiNat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">topologicalSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">equivPiNat</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">topologicalSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TopologicalSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ωSequence</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)]</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mem_open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ωSequence</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">xs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ωSequence</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsOpen</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">xs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∈</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ys</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">xs</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">take</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">++</span><span class=\"n\">ω</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ys</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∈</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">isOpen_image</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">homeomorph</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mpr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hs</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">end</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ωSequence</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">end</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Cslib</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>I got the following error message on the line before the <code>sorry</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">Application</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mismatch</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">The</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">argument</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">hs</span>\n<span class=\"n\">has</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">type</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">@</span><span class=\"n\">IsOpen</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ωSequence</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">topologicalSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span>\n<span class=\"n\">but</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">expected</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">type</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">@</span><span class=\"n\">IsOpen</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ωSequence</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">20</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">equivPiNat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">topologicalSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">21</span>\n<span class=\"k\">in</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">application</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">isOpen_image</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">homeomorph</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mpr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hs</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Why doesn't this type-check?  How do I make sure that the topologies on <code>ωSequence α</code> and <code>ℕ → α</code> are <code>ωSequence.topologicalSpace</code> and <code>PiNat.topologicalSpace</code>, respectively?</p>",
        "id": 608595710,
        "sender_full_name": "Ching-Tsun Chou",
        "timestamp": 1783378947
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>You can construct it like this, for example:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TopologicalSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ωSequence</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">haveI</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">eqv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ωSequence</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ℕ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">WithDiscreteTopology</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">toFun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toTopology</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊥</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">invFun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ωSequence</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ofTopology</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">left_inv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">right_inv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">eqv</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">topologicalSpace</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">homeomorph</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ωSequence</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≃ₜ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ℕ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">WithDiscreteTopology</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Equiv</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">homeomorph</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"kd\">]</spa